Jira Story Summary: Safe-Specific Session Recording Review Access

Story Title:
Configure Safe-Specific Session Recording Access for CyberArk Reviewers

Objective:
Enable selected users/team members to review CyberArk PSM session recordings for a specific Safe only, without granting broad/global auditor access across all recordings.

Implementation Actions
Create dedicated reviewer group
Create an AD/Identity group for the specific Safe reviewers.
Example:
CARK_AUDIT_<SafeName>_SessionReview
Validate target Account Safe
Confirm the target Account Safe that requires restricted recording review.
Example:
APP_WintelTeam
Configure platform recording Safe setting

Update the relevant platform’s PSM recording setting:

SessionRecorderSafe = PSM-{AccountSafeName}
This ensures future recordings are stored in a Safe-specific recording Safe.

Example:

Account Safe: APP_WintelTeam
Recording Safe: PSM-APP_WintelTeam
Configure recording retention
Set or validate the required recording retention value.

Example:

SessionRecorderSafeRetention = 180
Assign reviewer group to Account Safe

Add the reviewer group to the Account Safe with minimum permissions:

List accounts/files
View audit
Assign reviewer group to Recording Safe

Add the reviewer group to the matching recording Safe with:

List accounts/files
Retrieve accounts/files
View audit
Remove broad auditor access if applicable

Ensure users are not members of global roles such as:

Privilege Cloud Auditors
Privilege Cloud Administrators
This prevents visibility into recordings outside the approved Safe.
Perform validation testing
Launch a new PSM session using an account from the target Safe.

Confirm the recording is stored in:

PSM-<AccountSafeName>
Log in as a test reviewer and validate they can view only recordings tied to the approved Safe.
Confirm they cannot view unrelated Safe recordings.
Acceptance Criteria
Reviewer group can access session recordings only for the approved Safe.
Reviewer group cannot access recordings from unrelated Safes.
New PSM recordings are stored in the Safe-specific recording Safe.
Users are not granted global auditor access.
Permissions follow least-privilege access.
